MPIManager's wildcard import does not define `Error` in the module namespace.
When mpi4py import or initialization fails, the handler then raises NameError
and hides the original exception. Catch the Python exception base class so the
existing fallback/error handling can run.

--- a/DDFacet/Other/MPIManager.py
+++ b/DDFacet/Other/MPIManager.py
@@ -46 +46 @@
-    except Error as e:
+    except Exception as e:
